FFmpeg shared private FLV extensions
Base: 5a1f107b4c78318f318897900acad1b6c6aa3f9d after ffmpeg-7.1-legacy-hevc.patch

Keep upstream Enhanced FLV default; legacy HEVC writing is opt-in via flvflags=legacy_hevc.
Private raw Opus codec-id 13 has no OpusHead/pre-skip/multichannel mapping.
Upstream files retain LGPL-2.1-or-later licensing.

